{"seq":2,"slug":"gpgpu-patterns","title":"GPGPU 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/gpgpu-patterns","wordCount":1371,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gpgpu-模式\">GPGPU 模式</h1><p>会写一个把数组每个元素翻倍的计算着色器，离会解决真实问题还差一层：真实问题往往需要线程之间汇聚信息——求一百万个数的和、给每个元素算出它之前所有元素的累加、把乱序数据排好序。这些「需要协作的计算」无法靠每个线程各算各的完成，而是凝结成了一小批可复用的算法骨架：归约、前缀和、排序、直方图。掌握这几个模式，等于掌握了绝大多数 GPU 算法的积木。本篇建立在 <a href=\"compute-shaders\">计算着色器</a> 的工作组与共享内存之上，是从「会写 kernel」到「能解决问题」的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GPGPU 模式的共同难点在于：GPU 的强项是「每个线程独立处理一份数据」，而这些模式都涉及跨线程的数据依赖。解决之道是分层汇聚——先在工作组内部用共享内存与屏障做局部协作，再把各工作组的局部结果汇成全局结果，往往需要多趟（multi-pass）分发。理解「为什么要多趟」是理解所有这些模式的钥匙：一次分发里，不同工作组之间没有可靠的同步与共享内存，跨组协作只能靠把中间结果写回全局缓冲、再起一趟新的分发。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[输入数据] --&gt; B[第一趟&lt;br/&gt;每个工作组算局部结果]&#10;  B --&gt; C[局部结果写回全局缓冲]&#10;  C --&gt; D{结果数 &gt; 1?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[第二趟&lt;br/&gt;对局部结果再归约]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[最终结果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[输入数据] --&gt; B[第一趟&lt;br/&gt;每个工作组算局部结果]\n  B --&gt; C[局部结果写回全局缓冲]\n  C --&gt; D{结果数 &gt; 1?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[第二趟&lt;br/&gt;对局部结果再归约]\n  E --&gt; C\n  D --&gt;|否| F[最终结果]</pre><p>下表概览四个核心模式及其用途与典型实现策略，后续各节展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>核心策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>归约 reduction</td>\n<td>把数组聚合成一个值（和/最大值）</td>\n<td>树形折半 + 多趟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀和 scan</td>\n<td>每个位置算出累加值</td>\n<td>Hillis-Steele / Blelloch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序 sort</td>\n<td>数据排序</td>\n<td>双调排序 / 基数排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直方图 histogram</td>\n<td>统计分布</td>\n<td>原子操作累加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"归约-树形折半\">归约：树形折半</h2><p>归约是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个值聚合成一个值（求和、求最值、求点积）。朴素地让一个线程串行累加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个数会浪费 GPU 的并行性。GPU 的做法是树形折半：每一步让一半线程把自己的值与另一半对应位置的值合并，活跃线程数每步减半，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 步后归约到一个值。在工作组内，这个过程用共享内存与屏障实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wgsl\" data-code=\"var&lt;workgroup&gt; sdata: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;&#10;&#10;@compute @workgroup_size(256)&#10;fn reduce(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3&lt;u32&gt;,&#10;          @builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&lt;u32&gt;) {&#10;  sdata[lid.x] = input[gid.x];&#10;  workgroupBarrier();&#10;  var stride = 128u;&#10;  while (stride &gt; 0u) {&#10;    if (lid.x &lt; stride) { sdata[lid.x] += sdata[lid.x + stride]; }&#10;    workgroupBarrier();&#10;    stride = stride / 2u;&#10;  }&#10;  if (lid.x == 0u) { partial[workgroup_id.x] = sdata[0]; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>var&#x3C;workgroup> sdata: array&#x3C;f32, 256>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@compute @workgroup_size(256)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn reduce(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3&#x3C;u32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          @builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&#x3C;u32>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sdata[lid.x] = input[gid.x];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  workgroupBarrier();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var stride = 128u;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while (stride > 0u) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (lid.x &#x3C; stride) { sdata[lid.x] += sdata[lid.x + stride]; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    workgroupBarrier();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stride = stride / 2u;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (lid.x == 0u) { partial[workgroup_id.x] = sdata[0]; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个工作组得出一个局部和，写进 <code>partial</code> 缓冲；若工作组多于一个，就对 <code>partial</code> 再跑一趟同样的归约，直到只剩一个值。这正是上面那张多趟流程图描述的过程。归约的时间复杂度从串行的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到并行的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 步（在足够线程下），是数据并行加速的典范——背后的硬件原理见 <a href=\"data-parallelism\">数据并行</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前缀和与原子操作\">前缀和与原子操作</h2><p>前缀和（scan）要为每个位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{j&lt;i} a_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它是流压缩、排序、稀疏矩阵等算法的底层积木，比归约更微妙——因为每个输出都依赖前面所有输入。常见的两种工作组内算法是 Hillis-Steele（实现简单、工作量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）与 Blelloch（工作量最优 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、分上扫与下扫两阶段）。跨工作组同样靠多趟：先各组算局部 scan，再 scan 各组的总和，最后把偏移加回去。</p>\n<p>另一类协作模式靠原子操作而非共享内存。直方图统计就是典型：多个线程可能同时要给同一个桶计数，普通写入会丢失更新，必须用 <code>atomicAdd</code> 保证累加不冲突。原子操作的代价是争用——当大量线程抢同一个地址时会串行化，因此实务上常先在工作组内用共享内存的原子做局部直方图、再合并到全局，以降低争用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wgsl\" data-code=\"@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; bins: array&lt;atomic&lt;u32&gt;&gt;;&#10;&#10;@compute @workgroup_size(64)&#10;fn histogram(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&lt;u32&gt;) {&#10;  let bin = computeBin(input[gid.x]);&#10;  atomicAdd(&amp;bins[bin], 1u); // 并发安全的累加&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@group(0) @binding(0) var&#x3C;storage, read_write> bins: array&#x3C;atomic&#x3C;u32>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@compute @workgroup_size(64)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn histogram(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3&#x3C;u32>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let bin = computeBin(input[gid.x]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  atomicAdd(&#x26;bins[bin], 1u); // 并发安全的累加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>原子类型 <code>atomic&lt;u32&gt;</code> 的声明与可用的原子内置函数承接自 <a href=\"../rendering/shaders-wgsl\">着色器与 WGSL</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ping-pong-与多趟编排\">Ping-Pong 与多趟编排</h2><p>多趟算法在 CPU 侧需要编排：一趟的输出要成为下一趟的输入。直接原地读写同一个缓冲会产生数据竞争（一个线程读到的可能是另一个线程已经改过的值），所以经典做法是 ping-pong——准备两个缓冲 A 和 B，每趟从一个读、向另一个写，趟与趟之间交换角色。这种模式在迭代型算法里无处不在：粒子模拟的每一帧、稳定流体的每次迭代、图像的多次滤波。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"let [src, dst] = [bufferA, bufferB];&#10;for (let step = 0; step &lt; iterations; step++) {&#10;  const pass = encoder.beginComputePass();&#10;  pass.setPipeline(pipeline);&#10;  pass.setBindGroup(0, makeBindGroup(src, dst)); // src 读、dst 写&#10;  pass.dispatchWorkgroups(workgroupCount);&#10;  pass.end();&#10;  [src, dst] = [dst, src]; // 交换&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [src, dst] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [bufferA, bufferB];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iterations; step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginComputePass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">makeBindGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(src, dst)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src 读、dst 写</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatchWorkgroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(workgroupCount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pass.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [src, dst] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [dst, src]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 交换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把多趟命令录进同一个命令编码器、一次性提交，能让 GPU 连续执行而不必每趟都和 CPU 往返——这种「批量录制、减少往返」的思路是 <a href=\"../practice/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a> 的核心主题之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GPGPU 模式都在解决「跨线程数据依赖」，统一策略是分层汇聚：组内用共享内存+屏障局部协作，跨组靠多趟把局部结果汇成全局。</li>\n<li>归约用树形折半把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 聚合降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 步，是数据并行加速的范式；前缀和更微妙，需 Hillis-Steele 或 Blelloch 算法处理逐位依赖。</li>\n<li>直方图等并发写入场景靠 <code>atomicAdd</code> 保证正确，代价是争用，常用「组内局部+合并」降低冲突。</li>\n<li>迭代型多趟算法用 ping-pong 双缓冲避免原地读写竞争；多趟命令批量录制一次提交可减少 CPU/GPU 往返。</li>\n<li>这些模式为何快、何时受限，取决于底层硬件的执行与内存特性，见 <a href=\"data-parallelism\">数据并行</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPGPU 模式","id":"gpgpu-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归约：树形折半","id":"归约-树形折半"},{"level":2,"text":"前缀和与原子操作","id":"前缀和与原子操作"},{"level":2,"text":"Ping-Pong 与多趟编排","id":"ping-pong-与多趟编排"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/compute-shaders"},"next":{"title":"数据并行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/data-parallelism"}}